INT. HAUNTED HOUSE CALL CENTER - DAY

Cubicles painted black. Plastic cobwebs on the monitors. Headsets everywhere.

HOLLIS PEMBERTON (50s, supervisor, cardigan) stirs coffee with a pen. YASMIN TARHAN (20s, headset) types fast. KENJI MORIMOTO (30s, headset) stares at a ceiling skeleton. BEATRIX OYELOWO (40s, headset, rosary around her wrist) murmurs into a script.

Yasmin slams a key. The phones fall silent. Everyone turns.

HOLLIS
Anyone.

Nobody answers.

KENJI
The line's gone dead.

YASMIN
All of them.

A door at the back swings open. REGIONAL VP DARIUS ACHTERBERG (60s, tailored suit, ghost-white skin) glides in and stops under the skeleton. He looks at each of them. His mouth is thin.

DARIUS
Who scared the callers away?

Hollis lowers his pen. Beatrix crosses herself. Kenji, very slowly, raises a finger at the skeleton.

KENJI
It was already like that.

Darius studies the skeleton. Then the pen in Hollis's hand. Then the pen's bite marks.

DARIUS
Well done.

He leaves. The phones ring all at once.
